  "deepl:For local MPD instances, <code>/var/run/mpd/socket</code> is the most reliable default. If a local TCP host such as <code>127.0.0.1</code> is configured instead, the status page automatically falls back to the Unix socket whenever it is available.": {
    "original": "For local MPD instances, <code>/var/run/mpd/socket</code> is the most reliable default. If a local TCP host such as <code>127.0.0.1</code> is configured instead, the status page automatically falls back to the Unix socket whenever it is available.",
    "translation": "Per le istanze MPD locali, <code>/var/run/mpd/socket</code> è l'impostazione predefinita più affidabile. Se invece viene configurato un host TCP locale come <code>127.0.0.1</code>, la pagina di stato torna automaticamente al socket Unix quando è disponibile.",
    "timestamp": "2026-05-19T01:03:37Z",
    "service": "deepl",
    "github_user": "Ircama"
  },
