  "deepl:The status page can start a station immediately with <code>mpc clear</code>, <code>mpc add</code> and <code>mpc play</code>, or only queue it. Saving a startup profile sets <code>MPD_MPC_ENABLED=yes</code> and writes name, URI, image and homepage into the persistent configuration.": {
    "original": "The status page can start a station immediately with <code>mpc clear</code>, <code>mpc add</code> and <code>mpc play</code>, or only queue it. Saving a startup profile sets <code>MPD_MPC_ENABLED=yes</code> and writes name, URI, image and homepage into the persistent configuration.",
    "translation": "La pagina di stato può avviare una stazione immediatamente con <code>mpc clear</code>, <code>mpc add</code> e <code>mpc play</code>, oppure solo in coda. Salvando un profilo di avvio si imposta <code>MPD_MPC_ENABLED=yes</code> e si scrivono nome, URI, immagine e homepage nella configurazione persistente.",
